MATRIX: Univariate linear regression by gradient descent.
MATRIX: Points are [x, y]. The line is weight TIMES x PLUS bias.

ESCAPE THE MATRIX

HUSTLE predict WITH x AND weight AND bias
  CASH OUT weight TIMES x PLUS bias
DONE HUSTLING

HUSTLE fit WITH points AND rate AND epochs
  BUGATTI weight EQUALS 0
  BUGATTI bias EQUALS 0
  BUGATTI n EQUALS CALL length WITH points
  BUGATTI epoch EQUALS 0
  GRIND WHILE epoch IS LESS THAN epochs
    BUGATTI dw EQUALS 0
    BUGATTI db EQUALS 0
    BUGATTI i EQUALS 0
    GRIND WHILE i IS LESS THAN n
      BUGATTI point EQUALS CALL at (points, i)
      BUGATTI x EQUALS CALL at (point, 0)
      BUGATTI y EQUALS CALL at (point, 1)
      BUGATTI error EQUALS CALL predict (x, weight, bias) MINUS y
      BUGATTI dw EQUALS dw PLUS error TIMES x
      BUGATTI db EQUALS db PLUS error
      BUGATTI i EQUALS i PLUS 1
    STOP GRINDING
    BUGATTI weight EQUALS weight MINUS rate TIMES dw DIVIDED BY n
    BUGATTI bias EQUALS bias MINUS rate TIMES db DIVIDED BY n
    BUGATTI epoch EQUALS epoch PLUS 1
  STOP GRINDING
  CASH OUT [weight, bias]
DONE HUSTLING

BUGATTI points EQUALS [[1, 2], [2, 4], [3, 6], [4, 8]]
BUGATTI line EQUALS CALL fit (points, 0.1, 200)
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI line
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL predict (5, CALL at (line, 0), CALL at (line, 1))

BACK TO THE MATRIX
